> but even that doesn't work in the case of artifacts.

I love this distinction.  Monsters will pick up and switch to any
artifact not cross-aligned.  It's a clear-cut sign that any artifact
should be considered.  I also love that monsters will pick up
artifact after artifacts and always switch to the one most recently
picked up.  It's one of those tricks that Nethack uses as a trap
for folks who don't dig deep for meaning.



